usage: gossamer search [-h] [--max-results MAX_RESULTS] [--search-only]
                       [--provider PROVIDER] [--depth DEPTH]
                       [--max-tokens MAX_TOKENS]
                       [--use-smart {auto,browser,static}]
                       [--cache-dir CACHE_DIR] [--config CONFIG]
                       [--keystore KEYSTORE] [--log-level LOG_LEVEL]
                       [--fetch-mode {auto,browser,static}]
                       query

positional arguments:
  query                 The search query / research topic

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --max-results MAX_RESULTS
                        Provider results to request (default 5)
  --search-only         Return provider results only; skip page fetching
  --provider PROVIDER   Search engine to prefer
                        (duckduckgo/google/bing/exa/browser)
  --depth DEPTH         Candidate pages to fetch when not --search-only
                        (default 5)
  --max-tokens MAX_TOKENS
                        Token budget for the fetched-page corpus
  --use-smart {auto,browser,static}
                        Render strategy for fetched pages (ignored with
                        --search-only): auto (default; follows --fetch-mode),
                        browser (stealth engine first, static fallback), or
                        static (never renders)
  --cache-dir CACHE_DIR
                        Cache directory (default: ./.gossamer_cache)
  --config CONFIG       Explicit gossamer.json path
  --keystore KEYSTORE   Explicit keys.json path
  --log-level LOG_LEVEL
                        DEBUG/INFO/WARNING/ERROR (default WARNING)
  --fetch-mode {auto,browser,static}
                        Baseline render strategy for page fetches: auto
                        (default), browser, or static (env GOSSAMER_FETCH_MODE
                        / gossamer.json fetch_mode)
